  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Recovery Economic Support (PRES) Program, 2021-22 to 2025-26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Recovery Economic Support program provides high quality technical advisory services to the Office of the Pacific in the areas of economic analysis, policy and program development, program implementation, monitoring, evaluation and learning. This includes financing, private sector development, budget support, policy reform, economic analysis, aviation, trade, and gender.</narrative>
  </description>
